graph TD
    subgraph FineTuning [Fine-Tuning Pipeline]
        A1[Prepare labeled dataset] --> A2[Update model weights via training]
        A2 --> A3[Knowledge baked into model parameters]
        A3 --> A4[Static - requires retraining to update knowledge]
    end

    subgraph RAG [RAG with Vector Database Pipeline]
        B1[Index documents as embeddings in vector DB] --> B2[Retrieve relevant chunks per query at inference time]
        B2 --> B3[Inject retrieved context into prompt]
        B3 --> B4[Dynamic - update knowledge by re-indexing documents, no retraining]
    end

    style A4 fill:#e8734a,color:#fff
    style B4 fill:#5cb85c,color:#fff